X:1
T:As With Gladness Men of Old
T:DIX
C:Music: Conrad Kocher, 1838. Abridged by William Henry Monk, 1861 · Words: William Chatterton Dix, 1860
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: The English Hymnal, 1906 Hymn 39. Music from "Stimmen aus dem Reiche Gottes", 1838 by Kocher, Hymn 201 page 250. adapted by William Henry Monk from the original. Melody cross-checked against the hymnary.org score (hymnary.org/tune/dix_kocher): 100% of pitches and 100% of note lengths agree.
